    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302620/extras/370c1163035ed0c496becdd6461da9c2.poster.avif?t=1748893267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302620/extras/370c1163035ed0c496becdd6461da9c2.webm?t=1748893267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302620/extras/370c1163035ed0c496becdd6461da9c2.mp4?t=1748893267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2726\u2726 Why should you play this? \u2726\u2726</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own ragdolls wars in your own city in Sandbox Mode, play with guns, melee weapons, crazy vehicles and so much more. Simply enjoy everything you love about ragdolls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2726\u2726 What can you expect from this game? \u2726\u2726</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2726  Sandbox: Build your own cities for your ragdolls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2726  Play pre-built cities without having to create from scratch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2726  Save your cities and let your friends play it too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2726  Countless weapons and items for the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2726  Great Melee Combat Behavior &amp; Animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2726  Collect, Drop and Destroy items you liked</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2726  Good Melee, Shooter AI included.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2726  Stamina Combat Based System. Potions to recovery health or stamina.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2726  Customization: Change the look of your ragdoll from an assortment of skins and faces that you can unlock as you progress through the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2726  And so much more\u2026</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302620/extras/370c1163035ed0c496becdd6461da9c2.poster.avif?t=1748893267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302620/extras/370c1163035ed0c496becdd6461da9c2.webm?t=1748893267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302620/extras/370c1163035ed0c496becdd6461da9c2.mp4?t=1748893267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2726\u2726 Why should you play this? \u2726\u2726</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own ragdolls wars in your own city in Sandbox Mode, play with guns, melee weapons, crazy vehicles and so much more. Simply enjoy everything you love about ragdolls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2726\u2726 What can you expect from this game? \u2726\u2726</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2726  Sandbox: Build your own cities for your ragdolls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2726  Play pre-built cities without having to create from scratch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2726  Save your cities and let your friends play it too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2726  Countless weapons and items for the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2726  Great Melee Combat Behavior &amp; Animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2726  Collect, Drop and Destroy items you liked</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2726  Good Melee, Shooter AI included.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2726  Stamina Combat Based System. Potions to recovery health or stamina.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2726  Customization: Change the look of your ragdoll from an assortment of skins and faces that you can unlock as you progress through the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2726  And so much more\u2026</p>",
